\par\par \b \uc2  Malaysia offered to defend baht, says Thai minister. \b0\par\par\uc2 292 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Juni 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  KUALA LUMPUR, June 6 (Reuter) - Malaysia offered to defend the baht during a recent speculative attack on the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Thailand's Deputy Prime Minister and Finance Minister Amnuay Viravan revealed on Friday. \par \par \uc2  "There have been offers from countries (of the region), including Malaysia, but we have not used the facilities," he told a news conference. \par \par \uc2  Malaysia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank Negara Malaysia, has not commented on whether the Thai government had sought its help to defend the baht during a sharp attack on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in mid-May. \par \par \uc2  But the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market, along with the Bank of Thailand, to help the baht during the recent assault on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Central banks in the Association of Southeast Asian Nations (ASEAN) have an ongoing pact to defend each other's currrencies in times of such crises. \par \par \uc2  "There has been some manipulation, some attack on our \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Amnuay, visiting Kuala Lumpur on the invitation of Malaysia's acting Prime Minister Anwar Ibrahim. \par \par \uc2  "The situation has calmed down and stabilised," he said. \par \par \uc2  Amnuay said Malaysia had gone through a similar \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  turmoil in 1993 and "we can learn from experiences of Malaysia". \par \par \uc2  Since the assault on its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Thailand has introduced capital controls which have decreased foreign investors' access to the baht. \par \par \uc2  But Amnuay declined to give any details of the situation or how long the controls, under which overseas \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps have been stopped, will remain in place. \par \par \uc2  "It is not the place or time to discuss our plans," he said when asked if the country would formalise an exchange policy with other countries in the region. \par \par \uc2  -- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt6604fpe\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
