\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore Dollar Lower At Mid-Morning, After Early High \b0\par\par\uc2 240 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Mai 1997\par 05:03\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE (AP-Dow Jones)--The Singapore dollar is down marginally against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in mid-morning trading on Thursday, compared to its earlier high. \par \par \uc2  At 0300 GMT, (11:00 p.m. EDT), the U.S. dollar is trading at S$1.4305, up from its earlier low of S$1.4293, and unchanged from late trading Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Local banks which were earlier selling the U.S. dollar, were seen buying below the S$1.4300-level, according to a senior trader at one Singapore bank. He suggested that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  might have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the S$1.4295 level to hold down the Singapore \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The Singapore dollar is also slightly weaker against the Malaysian ringgit on ringgit-buying by Tokyo-based banks, according to traders. \par \par \uc2  U.S. and European funds are also buying the ringgit against the Singapore dollar, in order to cover existing short positions, said one trader at a European bank in Singapore. \par \par \uc2  At 0300 GMT (11:00 p.m. EDT), the ringgit is trading at S$0.5696, up from S$0.5690 in late trading Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Local short-term money market rates are unchanged from Wednesday, with the overnight rate on Singapore dollar deposits at 3.875%-4.000% and the three month interbank rate at 3.6875%-3.8125%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 29-05-97 \par \par \uc2  0303GMT \par \par \uc2  1163 1859 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt5t03tnn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
