\par\par \b \uc2  Thailand/Singapore/Central Banks-4: Deemed Ineffective \b0\par\par\uc2 310 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Mai 1997\par 11:14\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Data released by the Bank of Thailand in late April showed the economy at its lowest ebb in years: Manufacturing activity in February slowed to a five-year low, and private-investment activity dwindled to a four-year low. Imports and exports fell to their lowest levels in more than two years. \par \par \uc2  Some \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  experts said they considered the joint \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  mostly ineffective. 'We're not sure how much the authorities bought but the way the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is done doesn't seem to be effective,' the chief of regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  at a Japanese bank in \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  said. 'The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is now 20 pts above the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  level. It seems the market is having the upper hand.' \par \par \uc2  He and other analysts, who also asked not to be named, suggested that the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was unsuccessful because the two banks had not been aggressive enough. 'Maybe they lack dollars,' the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief at the Japanese bank said, referring to the Bank of Thailand. \par \par \uc2  A senior official at the Bank of Thailand declined to comment on that observation. 'We don't comment on money market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' he said. At the end of March, Thailand's foreign reserves stood at $38.1 billion, unchanged from February. \par \par \uc2  So far in May, the dollar has finished outside the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's trading band as often as it has finished within the band, four occasions. Some \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  experts said that may have tempted speculators to attack the baht. \par \par \uc2  'Because we've been trading above the fixing, the market perception is there's a built-in fault in the fixing,' said Robin Cheung, chief dealer for emerging-market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  at Hong Kong & Shanghai Banking Corp. in Hong Kong. That spurred fears that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may change the baht's trading band. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 14-05-97 \par \par \uc2  0914GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt5e03fe5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
