\par\par \b \uc2  Malaysia's Ringgit Rallies -4: Negara  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 200 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Januar 1997\par 13:42\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 's inflation is running at a benign 1.4% while a weakish local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  would make life easier for the country's exporters, who had a difficult year in 1996. \par \par \uc2  One cloud on the ringgit's horizon is the possibility that Bank Negara will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, buying dollars for ringgit to test sentiment or smooth out volatility. That might see some investors burned in the short term at least. \par \par \uc2  Kostas Panagiotou, senior economist at Kim Eng Securities, points out that Bank Negara, like most central banks, usually \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to evaluate one-way \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  movements to see whether the action is speculation or not. \par \par \uc2  Economists say Bank Negara keeps these \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  secret and often works through various other banks to cover its actions. \par \par \uc2  But the fact that analysts say there have been few rumors of Bank Negara \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday and there were only unconfirmed reports of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday, many believe that the ringgit's gains will last. \par \par \uc2  Bank Negara on Wednesday didn't openly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't comment on its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  activities. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 08-01-97 \par \par \uc2  1242GMT \par \par \uc2  1135 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt180020z\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
