\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore Dlr Slightly Stronger Vs U.S. Dlr; Range Narrow \b0\par\par\uc2 252 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 November 1996\par 10:08\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE (AP-Dow Jones)--The Singapore dollar is slightly stronger against its U.S. counterpart in late trading Thursday, but off its high for the day. \par \par \uc2  'The Sing' dollar is basically range bound,' said a senior trader at a U.K. commercial bank, adding that he sees a narrow trading range in the days ahead. \par \par \uc2  He said strong commercial demand for the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has driven its slight gains, with the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  touching an intraday low at S$1.4007 in early afternoon dealings. \par \par \uc2  The U.S \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is at S$1.4012 around 0830 GMT, down from S$1.4051 in early Asian dealings around 0045 GMT, and from S$1.4016 late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The dealer said fears among market participants that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MAS), the de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb the \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar's appreciation by buying the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , is putting a brake on the local unit's advance. \par \par \uc2  But he noted that local banks, through which the MAS might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , have been active buyers and sellers of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, local money-market rates are little changed. The overnight rate of Singapore dollar deposits is at 3.250% to 3.375% from 3.250% to 3.3125% Wednesday. The three-month interbank rate is also at 3.250% to 3.375%, flat from the day before. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 14-11-96 \par \par \uc2  0908GMT \par \par \uc2  1163 1859 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011014dsbe00yqs\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
