\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore Dlr Steady Vs U.S. Dlr In Light Dealings \b0\par\par\uc2 276 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Mai 1996\par 09:07\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE (AP-Dow Jones)--The Singapore dollar hugged a tight range against its U.S. counterpart in late trading Monday, with volumes depressed by holidays in Japan and the U.K. where financial markets are closed. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar was quoted at S$1.4039 around 0705 GMT, unchanged from levels in early Asian trading around 0000 GMT, but down from S$1.4050 late Friday. \par \par \uc2  'The dollar's not going to move from a S$1.4030 to S$1.4045 range for the rest of Asian dealings,' said a trader with a local bank. \par \par \uc2  She said demand for the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the Malaysian ringgit is contributing to the U.S. dollar's weakness, but any decline below S$1.4030 might trigger \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MAS) in support of the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The MAS, the de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  a handful of times in the past few months to curb U.S. dollar weakness. The trader said the MAS was rumored to have bought dollars late Friday when the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dipped to S$1.4017 in European trading. \par \par \uc2  The ringgit was at S$0.5626, down from S$0.5630 around 0000 GMT, but up from S$0.5623 late Friday. \par \par \uc2  In the local money market, the overnight rate on Singapore dollar deposits was quoted at 2.375%-2.250%, from 3.125%-3.000% late Friday. The 3-month interbank rate was at 2.3125%-2.1875% from 2.375%-2.250%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 06-05-96 \par \par \uc2  0707GMT \par \par \uc2  1163 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds5603ovb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
