\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore Dlr Inches Higher Vs U.S. Dlr; Range Narrow \b0\par\par\uc2 270 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 April 1996\par 09:15\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE (AP-Dow Jones)--The Singapore dollar inched higher against the U.S. dollar in late trading Tuesday from levels in early Asian trading, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  remained firmly rooted in its recent trading range. \par \par \uc2  'The market's very quiet. We saw some selling in the (Malaysian) ringgit/Singapore dollar cross early in the morning but it has had little impact on the Singapore dollar against the U.S. dollar,' said a trader with a U.S. bank. 'It's another 10-point range day,' he added. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar was at S$1.4056 around 0712 GMT, down from S$1.4060 GMT in early Asian trading around 0000 GMT, and from S$.4077 late Friday. Singapore financial markets were closed Monday for a public holiday and will be shut again Wednesday for another. \par \par \uc2  The ringgit was at S$0.5643, slightly up from S$0.5631 late Friday. \par \par \uc2  The trader said players are concerned about when the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MAS), the country's de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the U.S. dollar, as it has on a handful of occasions in the past three months. 'But \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 's not likely when the U.S. dollar's so soft against the majors,' he said. \par \par \uc2  In the local money market, the overnight rate on Singapore dollar deposits was quoted at 3.125%-3.1000%, down from 2.4375%-3.000% late Friday. The 3-month interbank rate was unchanged at 2.4375%-2.3125%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 30-04-96 \par \par \uc2  0715GMT \par \par \uc2  1163 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds4u03mlx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
