\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore Dlr Creeps Lower Vs U.S. Dlr; Trading Listless \b0\par\par\uc2 279 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1996\par 07:48\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE (AP-Dow Jones)--The Singapore dollar crept lower against the U.S. dollar in thin trading Friday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was quoted at S$1.4080 around 0645 GMT, below an intraday high of S$1.4087 around 0044 GMT, but above S$1.4072 at its Asian opening. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the stability of the U.S. dollar against other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the absence of market-moving news, and nagging fears of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MAS) - the quasi \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  - to support the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  all ensured the local unit hugged a tight range. \par \par \uc2  'We've seen hardly any interbank activity. With the majors pretty quiet, there's no impetus to do anything especially with the expectations the MAS will act on the downside,' a dealer with a major U.S. bank said. \par \par \uc2  'The dollar has very much been in a range of S$1.4075 to S$1.4083, with some attempts to push its upside in early trading,' a trader with European bank said. \par \par \uc2  He added that trading in the Malaysian ringgit against the Singapore dollar was quiet too, with the ringgit building support above S$0.5530. The Malaysian unit was at S$0.5544, up from S$0.5538 around 0000 GMT. \par \par \uc2  In the local money market, the overnight rate on Singapore dollar deposits was quoted at 2.500%-2.375%, from 2.000%-1.875% at about the same time Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The 3-month interbank rate was at 2.250%-2.125%, from 2.250%-2.125%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 15-03-96 \par \par \uc2  0648GMT \par \par \uc2  1163 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds3f02bvp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
