\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Singapore \highlight\uc2  Late-AM: Dlr Lower As  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Seen Likely \b0\par\par\uc2 329 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Februar 1996\par 04:26\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 SINGAPORE\b0 \highlight\uc2  (AP-Dow Jones)--The dollar is lower in late-morning Singapore trading Tuesday from levels an hour ago in Tokyo. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is close to testing levels against the Japanese yen at which the Bank of Japan is likely to step in and support the dollar. \par \par \uc2  'The market is scared of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  which has lent the dollar some support, but the trend is still very weak,' said a senior dealer at a Japanese bank. \par \par \uc2  He said the dollar benefited from limited buying after a fresh wave of fund selling had knocked the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from an intraday high of 104.62 yen. \par \par \uc2  The trader put the dollar's range in the next two hours at 103.75 to 104.65 yen. \par \par \uc2  'Testing \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  levels sums up sentiment today. It'll be interesting to see whether the Hong Kong and \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  authorities are used should the BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' a dealer with a U.S. bank said. Earlier this month the BOJ signed agency agreements with its Hong Kong and \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  counterparts through which it said it might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in dollar-yen dealings. \par \par \uc2  Around 0320 GMT, the dollar was at intraday lows at 104.25 yen, down from 104.38 yen around 0200 GMT, but up from 104.32 yen in New York late Monday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is at 1.4508 Deutsche marks, down from 1.4516 marks around 0200 GMT, but up from 1.4494 marks in New York. \par \par \uc2  Traders said trading volumes are light, but activity in the mark-yen cross is adding to pressure on the dollar against the yen. The mark was quoted at 71.89 yen, down from 71.94 yen at 0200 GMT, and 71.97 yen in New York. Sterling was at $1.5430, from $1.5410 at 0200 GMT and from $1.5410 in New York. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 26-02-96 \par \par \uc2  0326GMT \par \par \uc2  1052 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds2r01qhq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
