low of 105.10 yen hit earlier in the Asian day, and down from 105.47 yen around 0200 GMT. But the dollar is up from 104.97 yen late Wednesday in New York. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the dollar's performance against the Deutsche mark is largely tracking the yen. The dollar was at 1.4510 marks, down from 1.4532 marks around 0200 GMT, but up from 1.4495 marks in New York Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The mark was quoted at 72.54 yen, little changed from 72.58 yen at 0200 GMT, and up from 72.42 yen in New York. Sterling was at $1.5435, from $1.5424 at 0200 GMT and from $1.5443 in New York. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 21-02-96 \par \par \uc2  0336GMT \par \par \uc2  1052 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds2m01lax\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
