\par\par \b \uc2  Japan BOJ Will Call Dlr  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Says  \highlight22\uc2 Singapore \highlight\uc2 's MAS \b0\par\par\uc2 214 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Februar 1996\par 12:29\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 SINGAPORE\b0 \highlight\uc2  (AP-Dow Jones)--The \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore (MAS), the country's de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said Thursday that any support for the Bank of Japan in its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be initiated by the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  A spokesman told AP-Dow Jones that such an action will presumably take place when '\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is needed to be extended beyond the Tokyo market.' \par \par \uc2  Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Tuesday that in the previous week it signed unilateral agreements with the MAS and the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  to facilitate BOJ \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. \par \par \uc2  The agreements apply exclusively to dollar-yen dealing. \par \par \uc2  The Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  said the move enables two of Southeast Asia's most powerful monetary authorities to act on its behalf. The new accord is similar to a 1989 agreement between the BOJ and the Reserve Bank of Australia. \par \par \uc2  In the MAS's first comment on the agreement - Singapore markets were closed Tuesday and Wednesday for lunar new year holidays - the spokesman said Singapore is 'pleased to cooperate with the BOJ' and that 'such cooperation is important in view of rapid development of financial markets in Asia.' \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 22-02-96 \par \par \uc2  1129GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds2m01khi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
