\par\par \b \uc2  U.S. hasn't objected to Asian  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  plan - MOF. \b0\par\par\uc2 272 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Februar 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Feb 20 (Reuter) - Japan has not received any objections from the United States or other countries concerning its agreement with Hong Kong and \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  on dollar-yen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which was announced earlier on Tuesday, a senior \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MOF) official told reporters. \par \par \uc2  The pact allows the Bank of Japan (BOJ) to ask its counterparts in \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  and Hong Kong to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in dollar-yen trade in their markets on Japan's behalf. \par \par \uc2  Earlier, the MOF unveiled a pact allowing the BOJ to ask its counterparts in \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  and Hong Kong to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in dollar/yen trade in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets on its behalf, adding that a similar arrangement had existed for some years between Australia and Japan. \par \par \uc2  "You would have to ask the Federal Reserve about their reaction, but we have not received any objections from the U.S." or other countries, the official said. \par \par \uc2  The official also said that the arrangement with Hong Kong and \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  would increase the effectiveness of Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in those \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, which previously had to be carried out through private banks. \par \par \uc2  "It does increase the effectiveness of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he said. "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  through central banks can be massive and quite effective." \par \par \uc2  The official also said the ministry's Advisory Council on \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign Exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  would discuss "some possible deregulation" concerning \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  at its meeting set for February 27, including "some regulations with regard to \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  regulations imposed on securities companies". \par \par \uc2  But he did not elaborate, and said he could not predict the outcome of those deliberations at this point. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011019ds2k0167t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
